<!-- Entry point for the global Claude Code instructions. The shared content is
tracked in this repo; anything specific to this machine goes in
~/.claude/CLAUDE.local.md, which is untracked and imported last so it wins.
Deliberately a real file rather than a symlink: Claude Code's file-editing tools
refuse to write through a symlink, so a symlinked ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md could not
be updated in place. init.sh copies this here once and never overwrites it,
rewriting the path below to match wherever the repo is checked out. If you place
this by hand, check that path: Claude Code ignores a missing import silently, so
a wrong one leaves you with no shared instructions and no error. -->

@~/config/claude/CLAUDE.md
@~/.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
